          "Id": "marcus_195107_b18f_003",
          "PromptText": "A little smirk crosses his lips as he nods his approval.\\n\\nYeah, now you're catching on. As you have already noticed, a few, small fires have erupted up on this landing platform. The appropriate authorities are on their way to deal with the wounded and property damage, but if you wouldn't mind helping me with a few of these fires, it would be appreciated. You do that, I'll see if I can't help you out with your little... identity issue.",
